Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: Conduit
Source: https://github.com/thowd22/Conduit

Files: *
Copyright: 2026 Conduit contributors
License: MIT
 The full MIT license text is installed as
 /usr/share/licenses/conduit/LICENSE.

Comment:
 Conduit statically links and bundles third-party components whose notices
 must accompany every binary distribution. Each notice is installed verbatim
 under /usr/share/licenses/conduit:
 .
  Ghostty-LICENSE            libghostty terminal engine (MIT)
  SDL-LICENSE.txt            SDL3 (zlib)
  zopengl-LICENSE            zopengl OpenGL bindings (MIT)
  FreeType-FTL.txt           FreeType (FreeType License)
  FreeType-LICENSE.TXT       FreeType license selection notice
  HarfBuzz-COPYING.txt       HarfBuzz (Old MIT)
  Oniguruma-COPYING.txt      Oniguruma 6.9.9 (BSD-2-Clause)
  JetBrainsMono-OFL-1.1.txt  JetBrains Mono fallback font (SIL OFL 1.1)
